<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="micro title">模型服务</text>
    <text class="muted desc">
      填写 Key 后，录入只需给出俄语单词，释义 / 词性 / 重音 / 变位 / 例句 / 标签由模型自动生成。
    </text>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="micro label">服务商</text>
      <view class="chip chip-active">DeepSeek</view>
      <text class="faint tiny">后续版本将支持更多服务商</text>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="micro label">API KEY</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        password="{{!showKey}}"
        value="{{form.apiKey}}"
        placeholder="sk-..."
        bindinput="onKey"
        confirm-type="done"
      />
      <view class="link" bindtap="onToggleKey">{{showKey ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="micro label">接口地址</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{form.baseUrl}}" placeholder="https://api.deepseek.com" bindinput="onBase" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="micro label">模型</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{modelLabels}}" value="{{modelIndex}}" bindchange="onModelChange">
        <view class="picker">{{modelLabels[modelIndex]}}</view>
      </picker>
      <input
        wx:if="{{customModel}}"
        class="input custom"
        value="{{form.model}}"
        placeholder="输入模型 ID，如 deepseek-flash"
        bindinput="onCustomModel"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="notice {{resultOk ? 'notice-ok' : 'notice-bad'}}">{{result}}</view>

    <view class="actions">
      <view class="btn" bindtap="onTest">{{testing ? '测试中…' : '测试连接'}}</view>
      <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onSave">保存配置</view>
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onClear">清除</view>
    </view>

    <text class="faint tiny foot">
      Key 仅保存在本机，不会写入备份数据。
      <block wx:if="{{saved}}"> 当前模型：{{form.model || '未设置'}}</block>
    </text>
  </view>
</view>
